STEP N14 -- console login still works after the change                                PASS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Every console session after the secure-mode restart logged in from the start, because
  the console driver logs in on each call. Ten separate logins between 09:54 and 10:04 with
  secure mode enabled, including the first login after the reboot (`login seen after 61 s`).
  All ten reached a privileged prompt. Confirmed before logging out:
awplus#show privilege
  Current privilege level is 15
  => STEP N14 PASS: secure mode did not lock the bench out of the unit. There was no login
     banner, no demand to change a password and no delay. Local login with
     `aaa authentication login default local` and a local `username manager privilege 15`
     is unaffected by secure mode.

